index 57562412..4015ff74 100644
--- a/docs/music/MUSIC-RELEASE-20261119.md
+++ b/docs/music/MUSIC-RELEASE-20261119.md
@@ -263,3 +263,113 @@ own tools and the album's comment box (kept with the workflow's evidence, not in
